# codeloop lane: deploy (v1)

Run `codeloop card show <id>` first; the card says which stage it is in. Gates are approved only by a person.

| Stage | Skill | Output | Done check | Gate |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| staging | deploy | deploy/{id}/staging.md | `codeloop check file deploy/{id}/staging.md --has 'result: pass'` |  |
| verify | qa | deploy/{id}/verify.md | `codeloop check file deploy/{id}/verify.md --has 'result: pass'` |  |
| prod | ship | deploy/{id}/prod.md | `codeloop check file deploy/{id}/prod.md --has 'result: pass'` | prod (owner, before the stage runs) |
| smoke | debug | deploy/{id}/smoke.md | `codeloop check file deploy/{id}/smoke.md --has 'result: pass'` |  |

## staging

1. Run `codeloop card show <id>`. It prints the output path, the done check, the stage notes and any earlier rejection notes. Follow those over anything remembered.
2. Run `codeloop wiki inject --files <files you expect to touch>` and read every page it prints.
3. Do the work with the `deploy` skill (.claude/commands/deploy.md). Deploy to staging or production with verification gates
4. Write the result to `deploy/{id}/staging.md`.
5. Run `codeloop card advance <id>`. It runs `codeloop check file deploy/{id}/staging.md --has 'result: pass'`. If it exits 2, read the output, fix the work and run it again. Stop after 3 failures: the card parks as stuck for the owner.

## verify

1. Run `codeloop card show <id>`. It prints the output path, the done check, the stage notes and any earlier rejection notes. Follow those over anything remembered.
2. Run `codeloop wiki inject --files <files you expect to touch>` and read every page it prints.
3. Do the work with the `qa` skill (.claude/commands/qa.md). Quality gate — run all checks before promoting a task
4. Write the result to `deploy/{id}/verify.md`.
5. Run `codeloop card advance <id>`. It runs `codeloop check file deploy/{id}/verify.md --has 'result: pass'`. If it exits 2, read the output, fix the work and run it again. Stop after 3 failures: the card parks as stuck for the owner.

## prod

0. This stage changes something public. The card waits at gate `prod` as it enters. Do nothing until a person has approved it.
1. Run `codeloop card show <id>`. It prints the output path, the done check, the stage notes and any earlier rejection notes. Follow those over anything remembered.
2. Run `codeloop wiki inject --files <files you expect to touch>` and read every page it prints.
3. Do the work with the `ship` skill (.claude/commands/ship.md). Close the loop — QA, deploy staging, deploy prod, verify, close task
4. Write the result to `deploy/{id}/prod.md`.
5. Run `codeloop card advance <id>`. It runs `codeloop check file deploy/{id}/prod.md --has 'result: pass'`. If it exits 2, read the output, fix the work and run it again. Stop after 3 failures: the card parks as stuck for the owner.

